    "name": "📌 Xiaomi MiMo API",
    "description": "### About Xiaomi MiMo\n\n\"Xiaomi is a consumer-centered electronics and smart manufacturing company with smartphones, EV and smart hardware connected by an IoT platform at its core.\"\n\nXiaomi builds its own MiMo models and serves them through an OpenAI-compatible API. On the workspace overview it is listed under **Model makers**.\n\n### Prerequisites\n\n- Postman Account\n    \n- Xiaomi MiMo Account: [https://platform.xiaomimimo.com/](https://platform.xiaomimimo.com/)\n    \n\n### Usage\n\n1. Create a fork\n    \n2. Update collection variables\n    \n3. Send requests\n\nStart with the 🚀 Get Started folder.\n\nAdd your key to your **Postman Vault** as `xiaomi_mimo_api_key` (Vault icon in the footer, then **Add secret**, using that exact name). Requests read it as `{{vault:xiaomi_mimo_api_key}}`, so your key never leaves your device.\n\n### Documentation\n\n- API: [https://mimo.mi.com/docs/en-US/api/chat/openai-api](https://mimo.mi.com/docs/en-US/api/chat/openai-api)\n    \n- Models: [https://mimo.mi.com/docs/quick-start/first-api-call](https://mimo.mi.com/docs/quick-start/first-api-call)",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
